        "Economic and Nutritional Value of Citrus",
        "Overview of the Citrus Industry",
        "Career Opportunities in Citrus Farming"
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "title": "Citrus Botany and Physiology",
      "lessons": [
        "Anatomy of Citrus Trees",
